  "definition": "Requirement for Use of Stamps",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-12-01",
  "historyNote": "#4158, eff 11-3-86; ss by #4707, eff 11-21-89; ss by #5301, eff 12-26-91; ss by #6662, eff 12-25-97; ss by #8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14; amd by #10883, eff 7-11-15; ss by #12389, eff 9-27-17; ss by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13490, eff 11-15-22; ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
